{
  "title": "Hip Hemiarthroplasty Periprosthetic Fracture",
  "url": "https://www.orthobullets.com/recon/423186/hip-hemiarthroplasty-periprosthetic-fracture",
  "subtitle": "Updated: Jan 22 2025",
  "sections": [
    {
      "text": "Summary",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Periprosthetic fractures involving hip hemiarthroplasty are rare fractures that occur near or around femoral stems, often caused by low energy trauma, leading to possible implant instability, pain, and immobility.",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "text": "These fractures typically occur in geriatric patients with underlying osteoporosis.",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "1",
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "text": "Treatment usually involves open reduction and internal fixation or revision hip arthroplasty, although certain fractures can be treated nonoperatively.",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Epidemiology",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Incidence",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "approximately 1 to 4% of all hip hemiarthroplasties",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "1 to 7.4% of uncemented hemiarthroplasties",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "3",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "0.2 to 1.3% of cemented hemiarthroplasties",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "3",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
